('HMM_PARTNER','HMM Partner','ALL','COMMON','Bulk Containers','RESTRICTED','BULK','1. Bulk containers are prohibited except closed bulk containers (BK2). 2. Acceptable loading in SOC (shipper own container) BK2 container only per IMDG Code 6.9.3.','COMMON_REMARK','1. Bulk containers are prohibited except closed bulk containers (BK2). 2. Acceptable loading in SOC (shipper own container) BK2 container only per IMDG Code 6.9.3.','PARTNER',null,null,'Closed bulk container BK2, SOC only',null,null,'HMM - 2026 Prohibited and Restricted List Rev1 (IMDG 42-24)','2026.10 Rev1','2026-10-15',170,true),
