('HMM_PARTNER','HMM Partner','ALL','COMMON','Vanning survey','RESTRICTED','VANNING_SURVEY','Vanning survey may be done by a competent marine surveyor as third party. 1. Vanning survey is required in case SOL requests it. 2. All packages properly packed, blocked and braced. 3. Container clean, dry and fit. 4. No incompatible goods packed together. 5. Packages externally inspected, only sound packages packed. 6. Container and packages properly marked, labeled and placarded. 7. Cargo operator arranges and carries out survey for restricted DGs on its own account.','COMMON_REMARK','Vanning survey may be done by a competent marine surveyor as third party. 1. Vanning survey is required in case SOL requests it. 2. All packages properly packed, blocked and braced. 3. Container clean, dry and fit. 4. No incompatible goods packed together. 5. Packages externally inspected, only sound packages packed. 6. Container and packages properly marked, labeled and placarded. 7. Cargo operator arranges and carries out survey for restricted DGs on its own account.','PARTNER',null,null,null,null,'Vanning survey report if requested','HMM - 2026 Prohibited and Restricted List Rev1 (IMDG 42-24)','2026.10 Rev1','2026-10-15',190,true),
('HMM_PARTNER','HMM Partner','ALL','COMMON','Haz Waste','RESTRICTED','HAZ_WASTE','1. Haz waste shipment is acceptable only for HMM booking on HMM owned or operated vessel. 2. Hazardous waste in/out bound of North America case by case with prior approval from HMM HASA HAZMAT: port CY to CY only (no DR); US rail case by case with railroad approval proof; Canada import/export prohibited. 3. Acceptable only when: the word WASTE is added to the PSN on all DG documents; export permission, import permission (import and transshipment country), transit approval (way-port), all Basel Convention Article 6 documents, letter of guarantee if not covered by Basel Convention, and all other local documentation are provided.','COMMON_REMARK','1. Haz waste shipment is acceptable only for HMM booking on HMM owned or operated vessel. 2. Hazardous waste in/out bound of North America case by case with prior approval from HMM HASA HAZMAT: port CY to CY only (no DR); US rail case by case with railroad approval proof; Canada import/export prohibited. 3. Acceptable only when: the word WASTE is added to the PSN on all DG documents; export permission, import permission (import and transshipment country), transit approval (way-port), all Basel Convention Article 6 documents, letter of guarantee if not covered by Basel Convention, and all other local documentation are provided.','PARTNER',null,null,null,null,'Export / import / transit approvals, Basel Convention documents, letter of guarantee as applicable','HMM - 2026 Prohibited and Restricted List Rev1 (IMDG 42-24)','2026.10 Rev1','2026-10-15',200,true),
('HMM_PARTNER','HMM Partner','ALL','COMMON','Prohibit on US rail','PROHIBITED','US_RAIL','Prohibited on US rail: 1. All Class 2 in bulk packaging (tank). 2. Class 2.3. 3. Class 6.1 with Poison Inhalation Hazard zone. 4. All classes with sub-risk of Poison Inhalation Hazard zone. 5. Hazardous waste.','COMMON_REMARK','Prohibited on US rail: 1. All Class 2 in bulk packaging (tank). 2. Class 2.3. 3. Class 6.1 with Poison Inhalation Hazard zone. 4. All classes with sub-risk of Poison Inhalation Hazard zone. 5. Hazardous waste.','PARTNER',null,null,null,null,null,'HMM - 2026 Prohibited and Restricted List Rev1 (IMDG 42-24)','2026.10 Rev1','2026-10-15',210,true),
