('HMM_PARTNER','HMM Partner','3','ALL','Flammable liquids','RESTRICTED',null,'Class 3 restricted. Prohibit all PG I, II (flash point below 23C) in live reefer container; reefer temperature shall be set at least 10C below flashpoint. If the vessel arrives or transits Singapore, Class 3 with subsidiary risk of Class 6.1 carried in isotanks is prohibited. Verify flash point before final acceptance.','CLASS_ALL','Class 3 restricted. Prohibit all PG I, II (flash point below 23C) in live reefer container; reefer temperature shall be set at least 10C below flashpoint. If the vessel arrives or transits Singapore, Class 3 with subsidiary risk of Class 6.1 carried in isotanks is prohibited. Verify flash point before final acceptance.','PARTNER',null,null,'Live reefer: PG I/II with F/P < 23C prohibited',null,null,'HMM - 2026 Prohibited and Restricted List Rev1 (IMDG 42-24)','2026.10 Rev1','2026-10-15',270,true),
