('HMM_PARTNER','HMM Partner','9','3090','LITHIUM METAL BATTERIES (including Lithium Alloy Batteries)','RESTRICTED','BATTERY','All batteries made by Aricell (manufacturer) are prohibited. Acceptable only in reefer container with vent close / on deck only. All used and waste battery (including defective battery) prohibited, only new battery allowed. Such conditions are required for Non-DG also.','UNNO','All batteries made by Aricell (manufacturer) are prohibited. Acceptable only in reefer container with vent close / on deck only. All used and waste battery (including defective battery) prohibited, only new battery allowed. Such conditions are required for Non-DG also.','PARTNER',null,null,'Reefer container with vent close','On deck only',null,'HMM - 2026 Prohibited and Restricted List Rev1 (IMDG 42-24)','2026.10 Rev1','2026-10-15',1770,true),
('HMM_PARTNER','HMM Partner','9','3091','LITHIUM METAL BATTERIES CONTAINED IN EQUIPMENT or LITHIUM METAL BATTERIES PACKED WITH EQUIPMENT (including Lithium Alloy Batteries)','RESTRICTED','BATTERY','All batteries made by Aricell (manufacturer) are prohibited. On deck only. All used and waste battery (including defective battery) prohibited, only new battery allowed. Such conditions are required for Non-DG also.','UNNO','All batteries made by Aricell (manufacturer) are prohibited. On deck only. All used and waste battery (including defective battery) prohibited, only new battery allowed. Such conditions are required for Non-DG also.','PARTNER',null,null,null,'On deck only',null,'HMM - 2026 Prohibited and Restricted List Rev1 (IMDG 42-24)','2026.10 Rev1','2026-10-15',1780,true),
('HMM_PARTNER','HMM Partner','9','3480','LITHIUM ION BATTERIES (including Lithium Ion Polymer Batteries)','PROHIBITED','HMM_BOOKING_ONLY','Partner column is X - prohibited for Partner booking. HMM booking only: prohibit all Li-ion batteries except outbound from KOREA / JAPAN. For KOR/JPN outbound: 1) used / waste / defective battery prohibited, only new battery allowed; 2) specific manufacturer and made in KOR / JPN (KOR: LG / SAMSUNG / SK; JPN: Panasonic / Blue Energy (GS Yuasa) / Maxell / Fuji Denki Kagaku (FDK) / Toshiba); 3) acceptable only in reefer container with vent close; 4) LOI written by manufacturer and F/Forwarder; 5) on-deck only / HMM booking on HMM vessel only. Non-DG per SP188 allowed without the above but "On-Deck Special Stowage Request" must be submitted case by case. Special exception outbound from CHINA for LG and SK only (LG Energy Solution from Nanjing / SK On (Eve energy joint venture) from HKG and DCB to KOR) under the same conditions.','HMM_BOOKING_ONLY','Partner column is X - prohibited for Partner booking. HMM booking only: prohibit all Li-ion batteries except outbound from KOREA / JAPAN. For KOR/JPN outbound: 1) used / waste / defective battery prohibited, only new battery allowed; 2) specific manufacturer and made in KOR / JPN (KOR: LG / SAMSUNG / SK; JPN: Panasonic / Blue Energy (GS Yuasa) / Maxell / Fuji Denki Kagaku (FDK) / Toshiba); 3) acceptable only in reefer container with vent close; 4) LOI written by manufacturer and F/Forwarder; 5) on-deck only / HMM booking on HMM vessel only. Non-DG per SP188 allowed without the above but "On-Deck Special Stowage Request" must be submitted case by case. Special exception outbound from CHINA for LG and SK only (LG Energy Solution from Nanjing / SK On (Eve energy joint venture) from HKG and DCB to KOR) under the same conditions.','PARTNER',null,null,'Reefer container with vent close (HMM booking)','On deck only (HMM booking)','LOI by manufacturer and F/Forwarder (HMM booking)','HMM - 2026 Prohibited and Restricted List Rev1 (IMDG 42-24)','2026.10 Rev1','2026-10-15',1790,true),
('HMM_PARTNER','HMM Partner','9','3481','LITHIUM ION BATTERIES CONTAINED IN EQUIPMENT or LITHIUM ION BATTERIES PACKED WITH EQUIPMENT (including Lithium Ion Polymer Batteries)','PROHIBITED','HMM_BOOKING_ONLY','Partner column is X - prohibited for Partner booking. HMM booking only: prohibit all Li-ion batteries except outbound from KOREA / JAPAN. For KOR/JPN outbound: 1) used / waste / defective battery prohibited, only new battery allowed; 2) specific manufacturer and made in KOR / JPN only (KOR: LG / SAMSUNG / SK; JPN: Panasonic / Blue Energy (GS Yuasa) / Maxell / Fuji Denki Kagaku (FDK) / Toshiba); 3) LOI written by manufacturer and F/Forwarder; 4) on-deck only / HMM booking on HMM vessel only; 5) battery in equipment must be isolated with non-conductive material to prevent accidental activation and short-circuit. Non-DG per SP188 allowed without the above but "On-Deck Special Stowage Request" must be submitted case by case. Special exception outbound from CHINA for SK only (SK On (Eve energy joint venture) from HKG and DCB to KOR) in reefer container with vent close under the same conditions.','HMM_BOOKING_ONLY','Partner column is X - prohibited for Partner booking. HMM booking only: prohibit all Li-ion batteries except outbound from KOREA / JAPAN. For KOR/JPN outbound: 1) used / waste / defective battery prohibited, only new battery allowed; 2) specific manufacturer and made in KOR / JPN only (KOR: LG / SAMSUNG / SK; JPN: Panasonic / Blue Energy (GS Yuasa) / Maxell / Fuji Denki Kagaku (FDK) / Toshiba); 3) LOI written by manufacturer and F/Forwarder; 4) on-deck only / HMM booking on HMM vessel only; 5) battery in equipment must be isolated with non-conductive material to prevent accidental activation and short-circuit. Non-DG per SP188 allowed without the above but "On-Deck Special Stowage Request" must be submitted case by case. Special exception outbound from CHINA for SK only (SK On (Eve energy joint venture) from HKG and DCB to KOR) in reefer container with vent close under the same conditions.','PARTNER',null,null,null,'On deck only (HMM booking)','LOI by manufacturer and F/Forwarder (HMM booking)','HMM - 2026 Prohibited and Restricted List Rev1 (IMDG 42-24)','2026.10 Rev1','2026-10-15',1800,true),
