('HMM_PARTNER','HMM Partner','9','3556','VEHICLE, LITHIUM ION BATTERY POWERED','PROHIBITED','HMM_BOOKING_ONLY','Partner column is X - prohibited for Partner booking. HMM booking only: prohibit all kinds of vehicle / equipment with Li-ion batteries except outbound from KOR / JPN. For KOR/JPN outbound: 1) all vehicles with used / waste / defective battery prohibited, only new battery allowed; 2) specific battery manufacturer and made in KOR / JPN only (KOR: LG / SAMSUNG / SK; JPN: Panasonic / Blue Energy (GS Yuasa) / Maxell / Fuji Denki Kagaku (FDK) / Toshiba); 3) LOI by maker (including SOC - state of charge - data) and F/Forwarder; 4) on-deck only / HMM booking + HMM vessel only (allowed max 20 TEU per vessel); 5) battery in equipment must be isolated with non-conductive material to prevent accidental activation and short-circuit.','HMM_BOOKING_ONLY','Partner column is X - prohibited for Partner booking. HMM booking only: prohibit all kinds of vehicle / equipment with Li-ion batteries except outbound from KOR / JPN. For KOR/JPN outbound: 1) all vehicles with used / waste / defective battery prohibited, only new battery allowed; 2) specific battery manufacturer and made in KOR / JPN only (KOR: LG / SAMSUNG / SK; JPN: Panasonic / Blue Energy (GS Yuasa) / Maxell / Fuji Denki Kagaku (FDK) / Toshiba); 3) LOI by maker (including SOC - state of charge - data) and F/Forwarder; 4) on-deck only / HMM booking + HMM vessel only (allowed max 20 TEU per vessel); 5) battery in equipment must be isolated with non-conductive material to prevent accidental activation and short-circuit.','PARTNER',null,null,null,'On deck only, max 20 TEU/vessel (HMM booking)','LOI by maker incl. SOC data and F/Forwarder (HMM booking)','HMM - 2026 Prohibited and Restricted List Rev1 (IMDG 42-24)','2026.10 Rev1','2026-10-15',1840,true),
